@lang en

IMPORT prelude

-- ===========================================================================
-- Credit-point figures PUBLISHED BY THE ISRAEL TAX AUTHORITY. NOT ENCODED LAW.
--
-- The law's figure for a credit point in a tax year is the s 33A amount
-- (NIS 504) as indexed under s 120B, a section this row does not encode (row
-- IL-03). The rules in ito-s33a-credit-point.l4 and ito-s34-s36-s36a-credits.l4
-- therefore take the figure as an input. This module records what the Tax
-- Authority has published, so that tests and callers can use a sourced number
-- rather than an invented one. Each figure is the Authority's statement; the
-- Authority's own documents say they are general guidance and not the text of
-- the law ("הדברים המובאים כאן הם כלליים בלבד ואין לראות בהם את נוסח החוק",
-- itc135-2025 p. 4, footer).
--
-- Provenance. gov.il answered every direct fetch on 2026-10-06 with a
-- Cloudflare challenge page, so each document was fetched as the raw bytes of
-- an Internet Archive capture of the gov.il URL (the "id_" form, which serves
-- the captured file unmodified). Quotations are from `pdftotext -layout`
-- output with bidi control characters removed, checked by eye against the
-- rendered page; spacing around punctuation is the extractor's.
--
--   [itc135-2025] "דין וחשבון שנתי מקוצר לשנת המס 2025" — explanatory notes
--     to form 135 for tax year 2025, 4 pp., PDF title "135 - 2025".
--     gov.il URL: https://www.gov.il/BlobFolder/service/reporting-and-payment-2025-annual-tax-report-for-individuals/he/Service_Pages_Income_tax_annual-report-2026_itc135-2025.pdf
--     fetched:    https://web.archive.org/web/20260517174427id_/<that URL>, on 2026-10-06
--     sha256:     207412d97ed3daa65f49d42ae7e68e62e67e1f0dba674be40962989f7c9ad0eb
--     p. 4, section ח: "שוויה של נקודת זיכוי בשנת המס 2025 הוא 2,904 ש"ח. הזיכוי שיינתן יהיה סכום המכפלה של מספר נקודות הזיכוי בשוויה של נקודת זיכוי אחת."
--
--   [booklet-YYYY] "לוח עזר לחישוב מס הכנסה ממשכורת ושכר עבודה" — the
--     monthly withholding booklet, chapter ג "סכומים מתואמים לשנת המס YYYY",
--     row א "נקודת זיכוי 33א | 242 | לחודש".
--     gov.il URL: https://www.gov.il/BlobFolder/generalpage/income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet/he/generalInformation_income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet_monthly-deductions-booklet-YYYY.pdf
--     2024: capture 20240117140817, 38 pp., p. 11, sha256 35aed1177d28874577c85337e0184e94d58c675a5fba4c5b4866b9aea483e884
--     2025: capture 20251222010537, 37 pp., p. 10, sha256 41496dd374f5e3a397b17b5dfdfd2055537b66bac4c2fc4543d544406522fd73
--     2026: capture 20260207101513, 36 pp., p. 9,  sha256 282bb886ccae1cc718840127af378fce88ca37ee3b2b9f00ed2cd44467e86285
--     all fetched on 2026-10-06.
--
-- The monthly figure is the booklet's, for withholding from salary; s 33A
-- defines a credit point as an amount "לשנת מס" (per tax year). This module
-- does not derive an annual figure from a monthly one: the only annual
-- figure it carries is the one the Authority printed.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Credit-point figures published by the Israel Tax Authority — not encoded law`

@ref Israel Tax Authority, no annual figure sourced for this tax year
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no annual credit-point value published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding` MEANS
    REFUSE "no annual credit-point value published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding"

@ref Israel Tax Authority, no monthly figure sourced for this tax year
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no monthly credit-point figure published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding` MEANS
    REFUSE "no monthly credit-point figure published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding"

-- NIS per credit point, per tax year, as the Authority states it.
-- (0.2.0) By s 120B(e)(1) (line 4344, row IL-03, not encoded here) the
-- amounts s 120B adjusts, credit points among them, are not adjusted on
-- 1 January of tax years 2025 to 2027 and stay as they were on 1 January
-- 2024 after rounding. So the 2025 figure below is, in law, the figure for
-- each of 2025, 2026 and 2027. This module still answers only the year the
-- Authority's document names (2025) and refuses 2026 and 2027: carrying the
-- figure forward is s 120B's work, which row IL-03 and the capstone do.
@ref [itc135-2025] p. 4, section ח
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, e.g. 2025
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the value of one credit point published by the Israel Tax Authority for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2025 THEN 2904
           OTHERWISE `no annual credit-point value published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding`

-- NIS per credit point per month, in the Authority's withholding booklet.
@ref [booklet-2024] p. 11; [booklet-2025] p. 10; [booklet-2026] p. 9
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, e.g. 2025
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the monthly credit-point figure in the Israel Tax Authority's withholding booklet for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2026 THEN 242
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2025 THEN 242
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2024 THEN 242
           OTHERWISE `no monthly credit-point figure published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year has been sourced in this encoding`
